OL,3,GNEWSAMysterious 'witch marks' revealed
OL,4,Aat 17th Century manor
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the hills west of Bradford is a 17th
OL,7,FCentury manor house where residents
OL,8,Fonce feared evil spirits so much that
OL,9,Fthey made special marks to protect
OL,10,Fthemselves - and they made these marks
OL,11,Fso permanent that they are still being
OL,12,Fdiscovered to this very day.
OL,14,FPreviously a medieval estate, East
OL,15,FRiddlesden Hall near Keighley was built
OL,16,Fby Halifax wool merchant James
OL,17,FMurgatroyd in the 1640s for his eldest
OL,18,Fson, John.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
