OL,3,GNEWSAMysterious 'witch marks' revealed
OL,4,Aat 17th Century manor
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow a National Trust property,
OL,7,Fhistorians at the site continue to
OL,8,Funcover a series of these mysterious
OL,9,Fmarks left behind by previous residents
OL,10,Fin an effort to ward off unwelcome
OL,11,Fspirits.
OL,13,F"These are things that have been around
OL,14,Ffor many centuries and were what people
OL,15,Fwho were building the house put in
OL,16,Fthere to protect themselves from evil
OL,17,For witches or bad spirits entering the
OL,18,Fhome," explains Amy Gregory,
OL,19,Fcollections and house officer at East
OL,20,FRiddlesden.
